  "body": "Andreas/Braunhold's 1884 engraving puts the Hotel's two main-block stacks near the ridge ends. Select the existing `gable_ends` kit so their centres move from2.1824/7.7376m to0.60/9.32m on the retained9.92m block. Count, shaft section/tops, brick material, roofs, openings and placement remain selected as before. All kit dimensions and the July1835 fitting date remain reconstructed; the picture supports relative disposition only.\n\nThe genuine one-Hotel MASTER/WEB and saved native integration are retained. This recovery adds the required ROADMAP checkpoint and an honest STATUS account, preserving all old history bytes and current Magazine acceptance docs. No producer, schema, assertion or camera changes.\n\nValidation:\n\n- [Independent geometry and four-group review](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/tree/a85085a3ab3d7e089eebc93590f89a388424b501/evidence/sauganash-2026-11-04/stacks7819-independent-geometry-and-four-pair-review/): only40brick positions move outward, confidence becomes reconstructed, and unusedUV repacking is explicit. Hotel remains **differs**; shop's three comparisons retain **matches**.\n- [Actual target body/source-credit BOTH proof](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/blob/0f10a7be3b3b0d7579841b63eadc0ead49587d24/evidence/sauganash-2026-11-04/stacks-pr1701-target-both-qualified/RECOVERY.md):1280x800 and390x780, zero pre-teardown errors, proper closure, six actual frames directly reviewed. The eye is a curated55\u201356ft flying inspection. The phone placement row start is clipped; its visible reconstruction/metric/date limits and full primary engraving citation are accepted. Actual execution was ona097; final95 differs in exactly two documentary paths, with all consumed source/runtime/asset inputs exact.\n- Genuine nativeStage3 BOTH107/0 executed on saved00163 after Magazine integration and carries by exact input scope. This is Stage3, not all15runtime parts. [SDK execution heads/results](https://github.com/kev